{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09149","headline":"宴别幼遐与君贶兄弟 · 韦应物","name":"宴别幼遐与君贶兄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乖阙意方弭，安知忽来翔。\n累日重欢宴，一旦复离伤。\n置酒慰兹夕，秉烛坐华堂。\n契阔未及展，晨星出东方。\n征人惨已辞，车马俨成装。\n我怀自无欢，原野满春光。\n羣水含时泽，野雉鸣朝阳。\n平生有壮志，不觉泪沾裳。\n况自守空宇，日夕但旁徨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}